<title>ITALY: TABLE-Italy's total reserves in June.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Italy's total reserves in June.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's total reserves stood at 108.248 trillion lire at end-June, the Italian Exchange Office said in a statement.</p>
<p>The office gave the following data in trillions of lire:</p>
<p>				   June 97	 May 97	June 96</p>
<p>    Total reserves	    108.248	108.908     112.742</p>
<p>    Total assets		110.141	110.799     114.579</p>
<p>     (of which in gold)	38.301	 37.491	39.479</p>
<p>    Liabilities		   1.893	  1.891	 1.837</p>
<p>    (of which short-term)     0.233	  0.238	 0.281</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 678 2501</p>
